    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Alba Jimenez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108268823710899094613/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAIpc_6J78wLjELQp3EMyvY5iQxmKHC3no5p6jd_-paENCcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I called to inquire about tailoring services and politely asked if someone could assist me in English. The person who answered responded only in French. When I repeated my request, he said, \"Well, you're in Quebec, so why don’t you speak French?\"\n\nAs someone visiting from the United States, I found this incredibly dismissive and unprofessional — especially since it was clear he understood English. To make matters worse, he abruptly hung up on me mid-conversation.\n\nI felt unwelcome and disrespected simply for not speaking French, which is disappointing in a city as diverse and bilingual as Montreal. I would not recommend this business to anyone expecting respectful or inclusive customer service.",
        "time": 1753473450,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mimi the Travel Bee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117542156103217041817/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJufuwpf_TeMGCkA-nEYnaOLVii1vwkfQAGJxD8Nj6h7VDhyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Excellent Service & Attention to Detail\n\nVery good service at Nettoyeur Aidan! The owner took the time to personally call and double-check my preferences for my coat, ensuring it would be cleaned properly without any risk of damage. That level of care and attention to detail is rare and much appreciated.\n\nI’ve had bad experiences with Nettoyeur Daoust in Repentigny last year, so I was hesitant, but I’m really glad I chose this place. They went above and beyond to provide great service, and I’ll definitely be coming back. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1739652162,
